    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26179" root="ضيح" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِيحٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِحٌّ</span> [q. v.]: (K:) ascribed by
IDrd to the vulgar. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also an imitative
sequent to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ريح</span>, (K,) [i. e.] a corroborative of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ريح</span>, (O,) in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ بِالرِّيحِ وَالضِّيحِ</span> [expl.
voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِحٌّ</span>], and therefore having no meaning if
used alone. (O, * TA.)

